  # I Compared Every Major AI Coding Tool So You Don’t Have To
  
  [![Eric Murphy](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:32:32/2*WorR6xBQzeQym36qcicNZg.jpeg)](https://murphye.medium.com/?source=post_page---byline--f05a6915c0d4---------------------------------------)
  
